@startuml
title UC-02 — Начало диагностики (концептуальная последовательность)
actor "Ученик" as User
participant "Vue / Telegram" as Client
participant "DiagnosticController" as Controller
participant "DiagnosticService" as Service
database "PostgreSQL" as DB
participant "StorageService" as Storage
participant "Diagnostic planner" as Planner

User -> Client : Начать диагностику
Client -> Controller : POST /diagnostic-sessions
Controller -> Service : start(instrumentProfileId)
Service -> DB : save session
DB --> Service : sessionId, COLLECTING_EVIDENCE
Service --> Controller : session
Controller --> Client : 201 Created

opt Ученик загружает собственную запись
  User -> Client : Запись + необязательная партитура
  Client -> Controller : POST /evidence (multipart)
  Controller -> Service : validate ownership, size, type
  Service -> Storage : save to private temporary storage
  Storage --> Service : storageKey
  Service -> DB : insert media metadata and evidence link
  Service --> Controller : evidence metadata
  Controller --> Client : 201 Created
end

User -> Client : Перейти к заданиям
Client -> Controller : POST /continue
Controller -> Service : finish intake
Service -> DB : read profile, preferences, evidence
Service -> Planner : propose questions or short exercises
note right of Planner
Planner must not claim measured accuracy
without a validated analysis method.
end note
Planner --> Service : decision with rationale
Service -> DB : persist next state, question/task draft
Service --> Controller : next step
Controller --> Client : questions or exercise
@enduml
